{
  "id": "E405",
  "title": "Apples Also Sleep",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-02-15",
  "synopsis": "You know, apples need to sleep as well.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50405/180a63935720e6f55eadd0b8f0926685b1629893.mp3?1581341653",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "苹果也睡觉\n \n晚上，三岁的乐乐还不想睡觉。 \n乐乐：妈妈，让我再吃一个苹果吧。\n妈妈：孩子，现在太晚了。苹果已经睡觉了。\n乐乐：你说得不对，妈妈。\n妈妈：为什么？\n乐乐：小的苹果可能睡觉了，大的苹果还没睡呢。\n",
    "traditional": "蘋果也睡覺\n \n晚上，三歲的樂樂還不想睡覺。 \n樂樂：媽媽，讓我再吃一個蘋果吧。\n媽媽：孩子，現在太晚了。蘋果已經睡覺了。\n樂樂：你說得不對，媽媽。\n媽媽：為什麼？\n樂樂：小的蘋果可能睡覺了，大的蘋果還沒睡呢。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n \n",
      "traditional": "\n \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Apples also sleep"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "晚上，三岁的乐乐还不想睡觉。",
      "traditional": "晚上，三歲的樂樂還不想睡覺。",
      "pinyin": "wǎn shang sān suì de lè lè hái bù xiǎng shuì jiào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": " \n",
      "traditional": " \n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It’s evening, and three-year-old Lele still doesn’t want to go to sleep."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "乐乐：妈妈，让我再吃一个苹果吧。",
      "traditional": "樂樂：媽媽，讓我再吃一個蘋果吧。",
      "pinyin": "lè lè mā ma ràng wǒ zài chī yí ge píng guǒ ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lele: Mom, let me eat another apple."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "妈妈：孩子，现在太晚了。苹果已经睡觉了。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：孩子，現在太晚了。蘋果已經睡覺了。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma hái zi xiàn zài tài wǎn le píng guǒ yǐ jīng shuì jiào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Child, it’s too late now. The apples are already sleeping."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "乐乐：你说得不对，妈妈。",
      "traditional": "樂樂：你說得不對，媽媽。",
      "pinyin": "lè lè nǐ shuō de bú duì mā ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lele: You’re wrong, mom."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "妈妈：为什么？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：為什麼？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma wèi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Why?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "乐乐：小的苹果可能睡觉了，大的苹果还没睡呢。",
      "traditional": "樂樂：小的蘋果可能睡覺了，大的蘋果還沒睡呢。",
      "pinyin": "lè lè xiǎo de píng guǒ kě néng shuì jiào le dà de píng guǒ hái méi shuì ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lele: The small apples might have gone to sleep, but the big apples are still not sleeping."
    }
  ],
